ettings in the right panel\n5. Observe the right side panel showing nothing\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAn empty new project made in Godot 4.8-dev7.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124074/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124074/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}